        <mxCell id="intel" value="TOMORROW: “INTELLIGENT” products&#10;V-Guard Sentinel (self-aware)&#10;&#10;• Predicts its own failures (battery RUL)&#10;• Learns your habits &amp; auto-optimises&#10;• Acts autonomously — even offline&#10;• Whole fleet improves via federated learning" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=13;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=12;spacingTop=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="690" y="110" width="400" height="320" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
